      "text": "HandsFreeOS Milestone 2: CRM Core. Same system as Milestone 1 (clean & airy, accent #2D69D8, Hanken Grotesk). Every screen is clickable: tabs, dialogs, the lead sheet, stage moves, the lost-reason dialog, the import wizard (press Run), stage reordering, and the phone drawer and sheets. Use the Accent and Theme chips above any screen to preview it recolored or in dark mode."
